E:BBWI) and beauty and cosmetics retailer stocks in Q2","src":"StockStory","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"尋找贏家：第二季度 Bath and Body Works （NYSE：BBWI）以及美容和化妝品零售商股票"}],"themes":[{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"財報","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-26","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1403568/000110465926035243/ulta-20260131x10k.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ulta Beauty, Inc. (\"we,\" \"us,\" \"our,\" \"Ulta Beauty,\" or the \"Company\") is an international specialty beauty retailer and a premier beauty destination for cosmetics, fragrance, skin care products, wellness products, hair care products, and salon services. The Company was founded in Illinois in 1990 as a beauty retailer at a time when prestige, mass, and salon products were sold through distinct channels – department stores for prestige products; drug stores and mass merchandisers for mass products; and salons and authorized retail outlets for professional hair care products. The Company developed a unique specialty retail concept that offers a broad range of brands and price points, select beauty services, and a convenient and welcoming shopping environment. The Company's target consumer is defined as a","zh":"Ulta Beauty, Inc.（「我們」、「我們的」、「Ulta Beauty」或「公司」）是一家國際專業美容零售商，也是化妝品、香水、護膚品、健康產品、護髮產品和沙龍服務的首要美容目的地。該公司於 1990 年在伊利諾伊州成立，當時是一家美容零售商，當時高檔、大眾和沙龍產品透過不同的管道銷售——百貨公司出售高檔產品；百貨公司出售高檔產品；商店出售高檔產品。藥局和大宗商品銷售店；以及專業護髮產品的沙龍和授權零售店。該公司開發了獨特的專業零售概念，提供廣泛的品牌和價位、精選美容服務以及便利和溫馨的購物環境。公司的目標消費者定義為"},{"en":"\"beauty enthusiast,\" a consumer who is passionate about the beauty category, uses beauty for self-expression, experimentation, and self-investment, and has high expectations for their shopping experience.","zh":"「美妝愛好者」是指對美妝品類充滿熱情、用美來表達自我、嘗試自我、自我投資、對購物體驗抱持較高期望的消費者。"},{"en":"The Company's U.S. operations (\"Ulta U.S.\") make it the largest specialty beauty retailer in the U.S. In addition to its U.S. operations, the Company has expanded its international presence through its subsidiary, Space NK Limited (\"Space NK\"), a luxury beauty retailer operating in the U.K. and Ireland, its joint venture in Mexico, and its franchise in the Middle East.","zh":"該公司的美國業務（“Ulta U.S.”）使其成為美國最大的專業美容零售商。除了美國業務外，該公司還透過其子公司 Space NK Limited（「Space NK」）（一家在英國和愛爾蘭經營的豪華美容零售商）、在墨西哥的合資企業以及在中東的特許經營權擴大了其國際業務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The Company is dedicated to delivering a best-in-class experience for its guests by having inviting, well-staffed and -stocked stores. Ulta U.S.'s member data and customer research suggests its guests prefer to transact in physical stores, where they can discover and interact with products and other beauty enthusiasts. In the fiscal year ended January 31, 2026 (\"fiscal 2025\"), 73% of Ulta U.S.'s loyalty members transacted solely within stores.","zh":"該公司致力於透過擁有溫馨、人員齊全、庫存充足的商店為客人提供一流的體驗。 Ulta U.S. 的會員數據和客戶研究表明，其客人更喜歡在實體店進行交易，在那裡他們可以發現產品和其他美容愛好者並與之互動。在截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日的財年（「2025 財年」）中，73% 的 Ulta U.S. 忠誠會員僅在商店內進行交易。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The Company's major competitors for prestige and mass products include traditional department stores, specialty stores, grocery stores, drug stores, mass merchandisers, and the online capabilities of national retailers and brands, as well as pure-play e-commerce companies and online marketplaces. The market for salon services and products is highly fragmented. Its competitors for salon services and products include chain and independent salons.","zh":"該公司在聲望和大眾產品方面的主要競爭對手包括傳統百貨公司、專賣店、雜貨店、藥局、量販店、全國零售商和品牌的線上能力，以及純粹的電子商務公司和線上市場。沙龍服務和產品的市場高度分散。其沙龍服務和產品的競爭對手包括連鎖和獨立沙龍。"},{"en":"The Company has registered trademarks in the United States and other countries. The majority of its trademark registrations contain the ULTA mark, including Ulta Beauty and two related designs, Ulta.com, and Ulta Salon, Cosmetics & Fragrance (and design). The Company maintains its marks and monitors filing deadlines for renewal and continued validity. All marks that are deemed material to its business have been applied for or registered in the United States and select foreign countries, including Mexico and other countries in Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.","zh":"該公司在美國和其他國家擁有註冊商標。其大部分商標註冊都包含 ULTA 標誌，包括 Ulta Beauty 和兩個相關設計：Ulta.com 以及 Ulta Salon、Cosmetics & Fragrance（和設計）。本公司保留其商標並監控續展和持續有效性的申請截止日期。所有被視為對其業務重要的商標均已在美國和選定的外國（包括墨西哥和拉丁美洲、歐洲、中東和亞洲的其他國家）申請或註冊。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["LULU","EL","DLTR","DG","TJX"]}}